Z||000007||Raydar||08-07-2001||12:02 PM||||There was a woman who worked at our company who was driving to work on I-20, reading a book. In a company car. A <I>marked</I> company car. <BR>Seems that one of the executives lived on the same side of town. <BR>He happened to observe this woman. Followed her straight into the parking deck, parked right behind her and asked her just what in the <I>hell</I> she thought she was doing.<BR><I>Busted!</I><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||6
