Z||000011||Ken Wittlief||08-08-2001||12:16 AM||||I overheard two women talking at work. One said she was driving in on the divided 4 lane highway and some idiot was going 50mph in a 65 zone<P> so she got right up on his bumper!<P>  Im thinking, WHOS the idiot?!<P> if anyone is acting the least bit weird, strange, odd, or irresponsible on the highway I stay as far AWAY from them as possible! If someone is acting abnormally then you dont know WHAT is going on in their head - they may be on the verge of going postal.<P>  My ego goes out the window when I turn the ignition key - if someone wants to drive like they own the road, then its all theirs! they can only occupy about 20 feet of roadway at a time - I'll give them plenty of space and drive on the OTHER 48 million miles of paved road in america.||||reg||11
Z||000012||84Bill||08-08-2001||02:35 PM||||I look straight ahead at ALL times unless changing lanes and when in traffic, I watch the 2nd car in front of me not the one directly in front of me. (unless its a POS suv or truck then get around it ASAP)<BR>If they are "brake tappers"  I apply a 3 second rule and pass ASAP. <BR>My side mirrors are pointed so I can see whats <FONT SIZE="3"><B>BESIDE</B></FONT> my car not <FONT SIZE="3"><B>behind</B></FONT> it.<BR>||||reg||1
